#: docs/architecture.md:21
msgid "The rules behind this page. Architecture describes the shape; the Skills govern the decisions. Adapters against profiles — . Where a new node belongs before you create it — . The repository layout and every graph kind — . Composing and verifying the MCP surface —  and . Where this page and a Skill disagree, the Skill wins."
